(Step 3: Invite Your Team) Tj
T*
(Navigate to Settings > Members and enter teammate email addresses. Each invited member consumes one seat on your plan. Invitations expire after 7 days if not accepted.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 4: Configure Alerts) Tj
T*
(Under Monitoring > Alerts, define a threshold rule \(for example, error rate above 5 percent\) and choose a delivery channel: email, Slack, or PagerDuty. Alerts are evaluated every 60 seconds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 5: Go Live) Tj
T*
(Once your data source, team, and alerts are configured, click Activate Workspace on the dashboard. Activation cannot be undone without contacting support.) Tj
